{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的S05等非定时感受词同时出现得过密，18秒内容易来不及扫；S07的“互相依靠”也比X原有的“也许对方需要他”更确定，略微削弱了人物内心的不确定性。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮词把每段心理转折直接标出来，感受又与音乐具体段落对应，比较容易抓住人物每一步为什么靠近、犹豫、害怕又逐渐接受。反复出现的船、水、摇荡、靠岸、定住等意象，也让音乐变化和人物关系形成连续的呼应；X虽然更清爽、容易扫读，但右侧短词与人物叙述之间的对应关系较松，音乐感受也相对概括。总体而言，Y的信息组织和情绪表达更完整，扫描负担则是它需要付出的代价。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aa226357-8f6b-4441-8471-9a10feec9e5d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T154408897907Z", "elapsed_seconds": 158.593, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:46:47.518092+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "68d02a72450f85959358aaeb18980f321acea81455c5ca20777c2cf513569798", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "too